Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:11.65,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's been 30 minutes in this tiebreak alone.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N光这一个抢十 就打了三十分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.42,0:00:22.48,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Let her serve.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N让她发球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.34,0:00:41.83,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分 她们打了{\fs78}31{\fs68}分钟还没打完
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.83,0:00:44.75,TL,,0,0,0,,这已经是网球最快的决胜方式了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.75,0:00:46.25,TL,,0,0,0,,抢七被发明出来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:48.51,TL,,0,0,0,,就是为了让比赛赶紧结束
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.51,0:00:49.95,TL,,0,0,0,,它没被发明之前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.95,0:00:52.19,TL,,0,0,0,,网球是另一副样子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.34,0:00:56.97,TL,,0,0,0,,发明它的人叫吉米 范 阿伦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.97,0:01:00.46,TL,,0,0,0,,美国人 网球名人堂就是他创办的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.97,TL,,0,0,0,,这个人有个执念
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.97,0:01:04.73,TL,,0,0,0,,网球什么都好 就是打不完
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.73,0:01:06.52,TL,,0,0,0,,一场势均力敌的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.52,0:01:10.15,TL,,0,0,0,,能从下午打到天黑 第二天接着打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.34,0:01:12.80,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}{\fs78}1969{\fs68}年温网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:15.38,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}{\fs78}41{\fs68}岁的冈萨雷斯和帕萨雷尔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.38,0:01:18.20,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}打了一场{\fs78}112{\fs68}局的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.34,0:01:21.59,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}小时{\fs78}12{\fs68}分 跨了两天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.59,0:01:23.13,TL,,0,0,0,,还没分出胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.13,0:01:25.72,TL,,0,0,0,,所有人都看明白了 这么打下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.72,0:01:29.39,TL,,0,0,0,,电视别排期了 球员先累死在场上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.34,0:01:33.62,TL,,0,0,0,,范 阿伦拿出了他的方案
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:35.78,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1965{\fs68}年 他自掏腰包
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.78,0:01:38.47,TL,,0,0,0,,在纽波特办了场试验赛 请拉沃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.47,0:01:41.20,TL,,0,0,0,,罗斯维尔这些大牌来试新计分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:43.52,TL,,0,0,0,,可他没想到 真正救网球的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:46.24,TL,,0,0,0,,是他最看不上的那个版本
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.34,0:01:50.64,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}他力推的版本叫突然死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.64,0:01:53.47,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}其实就是今天抢七的骨架
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.34,0:01:55.62,TL,,0,0,0,,局分{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.62,0:01:57.11,TL,,0,0,0,,不再一局一局打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.11,0:01:59.12,TL,,0,0,0,,改打一个小局定胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.12,0:02:01.71,TL,,0,0,0,,小局里先到五分就赢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.34,0:02:04.72,TL,,0,0,0,,最狠的一条是 打到{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:06.18,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一分定生死
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.18,0:02:08.96,TL,,0,0,0,,接发球的人还能选从哪边接
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:09.84,TL,,0,0,0,,也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.84,0:02:11.90,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分可能是发球方的赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.90,0:02:15.32,TL,,0,0,0,,也可能是接发方的赛点 双赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.34,0:02:18.53,TL,,0,0,0,,球员和观众都爱这个版本
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.53,0:02:20.29,TL,,0,0,0,,够狠 够快
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:22.48,TL,,0,0,0,,可拉沃他们几个大牌偏说不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.48,0:02:24.03,TL,,0,0,0,,赢两分才算赢球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.03,0:02:25.72,TL,,0,0,0,,这是网球的规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:27.21,TL,,0,0,0,,于是有了第二个版本
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.21,0:02:29.53,TL,,0,0,0,,先到七分 领先两分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.53,0:02:30.87,TL,,0,0,0,,范 阿伦气坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.87,0:02:33.57,TL,,0,0,0,,给它起名叫久拖之死
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.34,0:02:38.34,TL,,0,0,0,,比赛在两个版本之间摇摆了几年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.34,0:02:41.22,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1970{\fs68}年美网第一次用上抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:43.40,TL,,0,0,0,,升起红旗 全场就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.40,0:02:45.40,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜负的时候到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:02:47.98,TL,,0,0,0,,赛事总监塔尔伯特把话说透了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:50.91,TL,,0,0,0,,球员不买票 买票的是观众
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.34,0:02:56.92,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1975{\fs68}年 美网倒向{\fs78}12{\fs68}分那一边
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:59.76,TL,,0,0,0,,先到七分 领先两分的版本活了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.76,0:03:02.24,TL,,0,0,0,,就是今天的标准抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.34,0:03:07.96,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}年后的{\fs78}1980{\fs68}年温网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.96,0:03:09.72,TL,,0,0,0,,博格对麦肯罗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.72,0:03:12.97,TL,,0,0,0,,第四盘抢七 网球史上最著名的一个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.97,0:03:15.96,TL,,0,0,0,,博格先拿到冠军点 麦肯罗救了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.96,0:03:19.23,TL,,0,0,0,,麦肯罗拿到盘点 博格又顶住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:21.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The calmest man in the place.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N全场最冷静的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.21,0:03:23.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sixteen all.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N十六平
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.59,0:03:35.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Just, just out.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就出界了一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.96,0:03:43.88,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That was a winner, of course. McEnroe was absolutely nowhere near it, but it just missed.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这本该是制胜分 麦肯罗根本够不着\N可球就偏了那么一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:50.68,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And of course it's set point number seven for McEnroe.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N麦肯罗的第七个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.80,0:03:53.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Quiet please.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N请安静
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:03:59.24,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yes — two sets all!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿下了 两盘打平！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.84,0:04:06.58,TL,,0,0,0,,你数一下 麦肯罗在这一个抢七里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.58,0:04:08.07,TL,,0,0,0,,救了{\fs78}5{\fs68}个冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.07,0:04:09.79,TL,,0,0,0,,自己浪费了{\fs78}7{\fs68}个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.79,0:04:11.97,TL,,0,0,0,,最后{\fs78}18{\fs68}比{\fs78}16{\fs68}拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.97,0:04:15.13,TL,,0,0,0,,整个抢七打了{\fs78}20{\fs68}分钟 全场起立
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.13,0:04:17.83,TL,,0,0,0,,可博格第五盘还是{\fs78}8{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.83,0:04:19.26,TL,,0,0,0,,五连冠到手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.26,0:04:23.21,TL,,0,0,0,,王者的区别不在顺风球 在这种分上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.84,0:04:28.48,TL,,0,0,0,,抢七治好了拖延症
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.48,0:04:31.31,TL,,0,0,0,,可它治不了一个地方 决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.31,0:04:32.64,TL,,0,0,0,,很长一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:35.16,TL,,0,0,0,,四大满贯的决胜盘不设抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.16,0:04:36.86,TL,,0,0,0,,必须领先两局
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:38.51,TL,,0,0,0,,一场球最极端的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.51,0:04:40.30,TL,,0,0,0,,出现在{\fs78}2010{\fs68}年温网
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.30,0:04:41.74,TL,,0,0,0,,伊斯内尔对马胡特
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.74,0:04:44.67,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘打到{\fs78}70{\fs68}比{\fs78}68{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:56.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That sets up his fifth match point, and can he make it?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第五个赛点 他能拿下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.59,0:05:12.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How will Mahut respond?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N马胡特会如何回应？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.65,0:05:15.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Thank you, thank you. 30, 40.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢谢 谢谢 三十比四十
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.79,0:05:20.97,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How will he cope with the enormity of this situation?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他要怎么扛住这一刻？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.21,0:05:25.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How will he cope with the enormity of this situation?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他要怎么扛住这一刻？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.34,0:05:33.40,TL,,0,0,0,,记分牌被打到没法显示
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.40,0:05:35.72,TL,,0,0,0,,两个人最后是站着合影的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.72,0:05:39.19,TL,,0,0,0,,整场{\fs78}11{\fs68}个小时{\fs78}5{\fs68}分钟 跨了{\fs78}3{\fs68}天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.34,0:05:43.62,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}8{\fs68}年后 还是温网
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.62,0:05:45.65,TL,,0,0,0,,安德森和伊斯内尔的半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.65,0:05:49.44,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘打到{\fs78}26{\fs68}比{\fs78}24{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}个半小时
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.44,0:05:52.71,TL,,0,0,0,,安德森赛后直接开炮 再这么打下去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.71,0:05:55.74,TL,,0,0,0,,是拿球员的职业生涯开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.15,0:06:01.77,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Lefty, it's in!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N左手回球 进了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:02.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's in!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N确实进了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.41,0:06:09.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}We've seen it all!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这场面 真是见所未见！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.84,0:06:15.94,TL,,0,0,0,,这之后 规矩终于改了 {\fs78}2019{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.94,0:06:18.49,TL,,0,0,0,,温网启用决胜盘{\fs78}12{\fs68}平抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.49,0:06:19.71,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网走得更远
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.71,0:06:22.50,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘六平之后直接抢{\fs78}10{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:24.87,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2022{\fs68}年 四大满贯统一
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.87,0:06:26.63,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘打到{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.63,0:06:29.11,TL,,0,0,0,,抢{\fs78}10{\fs68}定胜负 领先两分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.11,0:06:32.79,TL,,0,0,0,,打不完的比赛 从规则上被判了死刑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.84,0:06:34.81,TL,,0,0,0,,而抢{\fs78}10{\fs68}最有名的一场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.81,0:06:36.52,TL,,0,0,0,,就是开头那场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:38.05,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68}年澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.05,0:06:40.07,TL,,0,0,0,,布林科娃对莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.07,0:06:42.68,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘抢{\fs78}10{\fs68}打到{\fs78}22{\fs68}比{\fs78}20{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.68,0:06:44.13,TL,,0,0,0,,她错过{\fs78}9{\fs68}个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.13,0:06:45.80,TL,,0,0,0,,又救了{\fs78}6{\fs68}个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:48.10,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}42{\fs68}分 三分钟 不对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.10,0:06:50.73,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}31{\fs68}分钟 才决出胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.73,0:06:54.03,TL,,0,0,0,,这是大满贯历史上最长的抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.34,0:07:07.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The grit, the will of Anna Blinkova is really something else.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N布林科娃的这股韧劲和意志\N真是太特别了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:15.39,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Elena Rybakina equals her in just that.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而莱巴金娜在这一点上 丝毫不输
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.82,0:07:21.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And is now the longest ever women's singles tiebreak at a Grand Slam event.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是大满贯史上最长的女单抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:25.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This day, I will remember for the rest of my life,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一天 我会铭记一生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:32.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Especially on this court, with this crowd, I will never forget it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在这个球场 这片观众面前\N我永远不会忘记
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.67,0:07:34.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's the best day of my life so far.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是我迄今最美好的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.34,0:07:37.18,TL,,0,0,0,,抢{\fs78}73{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.18,0:07:39.18,TL,,0,0,0,,从红旗升起的突然死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.18,0:07:41.25,TL,,0,0,0,,到{\fs78}22{\fs68}比{\fs78}20{\fs68}的抢{\fs78}10{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:42.77,TL,,0,0,0,,它救了网球的排期
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.77,0:07:44.65,TL,,0,0,0,,没救得了网球的争论
